<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_switch_php_extension">ActionSwitchPhpExtension</link></para>

<para>This class is responsible for enabling or disabling PHP extensions by modifying the php.ini configuration file. </para>
